### USER wlasciciel rezerwacje (tylko swoje)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### USER obcy rezerwacje (tylko swoje)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### ADMIN rezerwacje (wszystkie)
GET {{host}}/api/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### USER wlasciciel filtr userId 403
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?userId=3
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### USER obcy filtr userId 403
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?userId=3
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}

### ADMIN filtr userId
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?userId=3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### USER filtry i paginacja nadal dzialaja
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?status=CONFIRMED&limit=1&sort=-startTime
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ADMIN filtr roomId
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?roomId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN niepoprawny roomId
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?roomId=abc
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN roomId + status
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?roomId=1&status=CONFIRMED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN buildingId + zakres dat + sortowanie
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?buildingId=1&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-30T23:59:59Z&sort=-startTime
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN paginacja
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?limit=2&page=2&sort=-participants
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN niepoprawny sort
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?sort=name
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ADMIN from pozniej niz to
GET {{host}}/api/reservations?from=2026-11-10T12:00:00Z&to=2026-11-10T10:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

